# Reference material, kept locally but not committed.
# These are the original Spotnet 1.8/2.0 artefacts the reconstruction was read
# against. None of them is a build input: lib/Spotnet.exe is explicitly excluded
# in Spotnet.csproj, and the 2.0 release package is 27 MB of decompilation source.
# Anyone reproducing the reconstruction fetches them from the 2.0 release instead.
/spotnet-git/
/spotnet-2.0.0.284-binary/
/reference/spotnet-2.0.0.284-packages/
/decompiled_200/
/src/Spotnet/lib/Spotnet.exe
